Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:32:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: 20 more Lumbridge & Draynor / Varrock achievement diary
 task hooks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Problem. Most Lumbridge & Draynor and Varrock diary tasks could not be completed.

Change. Hooks in existing content: pickpocketing (a man or woman in Lumbridge, Martin),
fishing (anchovies in Al Kharid, salmon in Lumbridge, trout at Barbarian Village), willow logs
in Draynor, iron in the south-east Varrock mine, cave bug and Draynor Sewers zombie kills
(NpcDeathKillHook), a coif in the Lumbridge cow pen, a bowl spun and fired in Barbarian
Village, Thessalia's store, the Stronghold of Security's second level and its four emotes,
Chaeldar and Vannaka tasks, 20 mahogany planks at once, the Waka canoe (Lumbridge to
Edgeville; shaped at Edgeville), and picking a kitten's colour with a Ring of Charos(a) on every
path that offers it (Gertrude's Kitten quick-buy, the "[Charm]" option, the quest's reward
kitten).

Tests. DiaryTasksTest (integration): the skilling, kill and Slayer hooks check the item and the
area; a bowl spun and fired in Barbarian Village; the four Stronghold emotes and the Waka
canoe tasks. GertrudesCatInteractionTest: picking a kitten's colour completes the task on the
quick-buy, the "[Charm]" option and the quest reward, and a random-colour kitten does not.

Data sources. OSRS Wiki: Lumbridge & Draynor Diary and Varrock Diary (task texts,
requirements, Changes: the Draynor Sewers zombies, Lumbridge fishing spots no longer counting
for the trout, 20 planks in one go, four distinct emotes); Gertrude (choosing the colour with a
Ring of Charos(a) completes the task).

Caveats.
- Area boxes are approximate (the Wiki gives no bounds).
- The Stronghold emotes count anywhere; Hans's Talk-to "how long I've been here" option does not
  count (only the Age option), unverified.
- Slayer master ids 3 (Vannaka) and 4 (Chaeldar) are not checked against the cache table.

